https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Light\" title=\"Light\">Light</a>:</b> Certain rare magical items may be formed from light and magical energy. These items usually grant bonuses to light and healing spells.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">39\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0011700000</span>11,700<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">2 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><b><a href=\"/page/The_Curse_of_Strahd\" title=\"The Curse of Strahd\">The Curse of Strahd</a></b>, Turn in given by <a href=\"/page/Rudolph_van_Richten\" title=\"Rudolph van Richten\">Rudolph van Richten</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+15 Enhancement Bonus</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+15 Enhancement Bonus</a>:</b> +15 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Attack_roll\" title=\"Attack roll\">attack</a> and <a href=\"/page/Damage_roll\" title=\"Damage roll\">damage rolls</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Coruscating\" title=\"Coruscating\">Coruscating 6</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Coruscating\" title=\"Coruscating\">Coruscating 6</a>:</b> This effect causes the edges of this weapon to coruscate, dealing 6d6 Light damage on each hit.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Blazing\" title=\"Blazing\">Blazing 14</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Blazing\" title=\"Blazing\">Blazing 14</a>:</b> This effect causes the edges of this weapon to coruscate, dealing 14d6 Light damage on each critical hit.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Bane_(enchantment)\" title=\"Bane (enchantment)\">Undead Bane 6</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Bane_(enchantment)\" title=\"Bane (enchantment)\">Undead Bane 6</a>:</b> Those that have died must return, and this weapon is attuned specifically to lay them to rest. This weapon deals an additional 6d10 bane damage vs. Undead.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Brazen_Brilliance\" title=\"Brazen Brilliance\">Brazen Brilliance</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Brazen_Brilliance\" title=\"Brazen Brilliance\">Brazen Brilliance</a>:</b> With this item equipped, your offensive attacks and spells have a chance of creating a burst of pure light, dealing Light damage and blinding enemies.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Sunsword%27s_Power\" title=\"Sunsword&#39;s Power\">Sunsword's Power</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Sunsword%27s_Power\" title=\"Sunsword&#39;s Power\">Sunsword's Power</a>:</b> The Sunsword holds the power to render Strahd vulnerable to weapon damage for a short period of time.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Sunsword.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Sunsword.png/420px-Sunsword.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"563\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Sunsword.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><i>This blade of light cries out to destroy Strahd.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<ul><li>This is an in-quest item given by <a href=\"/page/Rudolph_van_Richten\" title=\"Rudolph van Richten\">Rudolph van Richten</a> to one of the player characters at the start of the raid.</li>\n<li>Striking Strahd with this weapon is required to make him vulnerable to damage for a short period of time. (This is not the same as the debuff <a href=\"/page/Vulnerable\" title=\"Vulnerable\">Vulnerable</a> - if Strahd goes a few seconds without being attacked with the Sunsword, he becomes completely immune to all damage.)\n<ul><li>Do <i>not</i> allow the player holding the Sunsword to be killed during the staircase section - if the Sunsword falls into a location it cannot be retrieved from, the remainder of the raid becomes incompletable.</li></ul></li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/page/Durability\" title=\"Durability\">Durability</a> is 390 maximum but it comes with 100 damage, so it is effectively 290.</li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260816174908\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.081 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.124 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3917/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 32698/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 10690/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n128.98%  137.123     54 Template:IO\n100.00%  106.309      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  106.309      1 -total\n 96.28%  102.352      1 Template:Named_Weapon\n 43.79%   46.558      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 42.78%   45.474      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 40.93%   43.517      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 39.71%   42.214      2 Template:InCategory\n 21.08%   22.413      8 Template:Popup\n 15.93%   16.938      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:68105-0!canonical and timestamp 20260816174908 and revision id 671273. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"
